    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should call them but i really don't want to deal with the ER or an appointment right now if it's not serious. i checked my sugar and it was just a little high, like 180, but not crazy. do u think i can just drink a ton of water and wait it out til the weekend? like maybe it's just the supplement messing with my hydration levels?",
